WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:10.310
♪ ♪

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.683
NARRATOR: February 13th 2017.

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:21.121
Kuala Lumpur
International Airport.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:28.461
Kim Jong-un's brother
enters the terminal,

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.631
unaware that two
female assassins are
also at the airport.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.816
Now, for the first
time on television,

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.952
one of the assassins tells
her full extraordinary story.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.924
MAN: Camera check.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.368
NARRATOR: It begins with
her being recruited by a man

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.904
who claimed
to be a TV producer.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.473
NARRATOR: For months,
Kim Jong-un's agents groomed

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:51.778
Siti and another young
woman to ambush unsuspecting
members of the public

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:54.814
and smother their faces
with cosmetic creams,

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.684
in what they thought were
hidden camera show stunts.

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:22.675
NARRATOR: Siti's handler
arranges a meeting
a café in the airport.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.081
There she is to receive
details of the target.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:31.344
NARRATOR: This time,
it isn't baby oil,

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:34.213
but a deadly nerve agent.

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:38.051
As Kim Jong-un's brother
heads to his flight,

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:40.153
the two women make their move.

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.871
NARRATOR: Seeking help,
Kim Jong-nam heads for the

00:03:58.938 --> 00:04:01.474
airport's medical facility.

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:10.116
MADDEN (off-screen): So at this
point Kim Jong-nam is

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:13.086
in the infirmary,
and he is behind the door,

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:14.721
and this is where this
image gets very scary.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:18.124
There's a
gentleman in all black,

00:04:18.191 --> 00:04:22.428
walking near this door, okay,
and he's got a rolling suitcase.

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:31.671
He's checking in to make
sure that Kim Jong-nam is
receiving medical treatment.

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:35.475
This is one of the operatives.

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.110
It's a very
elaborate operation,

00:04:37.176 --> 00:04:39.012
it's very old-school.

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:44.317
NARRATOR: The operation plays
out like a Cold War spy caper.

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:48.087
There are lookout men.

00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:53.026
A chemist, to handle
the nerve agent.

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:56.162
A getaway driver.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.800
And a team leader,
codenamed Grandpa.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:07.540
The young women have no
idea what they've done.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.579
(applause)

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:17.116
(sirens)

00:05:18.951 --> 00:05:22.355
They are soon arrested
by the local Malaysian police.

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:53.619
(speaking in native language)

00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:59.692
NARRATOR: The trial creates
shock-waves around the world.

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.766
TEIK: She had been charged
for the most serious
crime in the country,

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:08.301
the crime of murder.

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:10.503
For the offense of murder,
there's only one punishment,

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.638
and that is death, by hanging.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:23.349
NARRATOR: The chemist of
the gang is also apprehended.

00:06:28.187 --> 00:06:30.790
He is caught on camera
getting his story straight

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:32.592
with North Korean
embassy officials.

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:59.218
NARRATOR: This video evidence
helped to build a picture

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:01.888
of a ruthless political
assassination.

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:06.826
Both women were
released after spending
two years in prison.

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:33.753
NARRATOR: Kim Jong-un's
troublesome older brother
was no more.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:34.987
Captioned by
Cotter Media Group.

